msgid ""
"ArduPilot Serialx Port numbering is logical, rather than physical. Which "
"UART or USART port is assigned to a Serial Port is determined by the "
"autopilot's hardware definition file. Serial Port 0 is always assigned to "
"the USB port, but others can vary. Check its  :ref:`description page "
"<common-autopilots>`"
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot的Serialx端口编号是逻辑编号，而非物理编号。哪个UART或USART端口分配给串行端口由飞控的硬件定义文件决定。串行端口0始终分配给USB端口，其他端口可能有所不同。请查看其"
" :ref:`描述页面 <common-autopilots>`。"

