#: e8158fedf8c74b89bb27642324d90489
msgid "if bit 0 is set, then RX data received is inverted internally."
msgstr "如果第0位置位，则内部反转接收到的RX数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-options.rst:529
#: 5da3c028432248cda85a50e0200e53f8 9f4d2178e1da40ca90abf12880d1dd4b
#: e25f3f588701460ebfc06d505723290f eb1baa1806bf4428b990b76a69509c66
#: f11380a4652841429229e286cde039ce
msgid "if bit 1 is set, the TX data is inverted before outputting."
msgstr "如果第1位置位，则在输出前反转TX数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-options.rst:530
#: 0870188e2046412ba275b6387348e680 1025b5bc086d4f42b982767c5e84f030
#: 10cb2fcfb4f342df9c4a60ab1a4f32dd 8684c44a8f244e6db7feb8de2783e2d9
#: c1bbe552eca045ee8f54b32d49dea508
msgid ""
"if bit 2 is set, then HalfDuplex operation using the TX pin is implemented."
msgstr "如果第2位置位，则使用TX引脚实现半双工操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-options.rst:531
#: 3ab2dfdf7e7c4a059681c7a34c18d3f6 4a0d924bae2948659a19b2dc6d71dcb6
#: 52992360e04441d8a720f8d5f27ef68c 5f5bcc1cae7746deb6471039daedb25a
#: 86cf31f919d84b7db9c97eaf0c58ce8b
msgid ""
"if bit 3 is set, then the TX and RX pins are effectively swapped internally."
msgstr "如果第3位置位，则内部有效交换TX和RX引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-options.rst:532
#: 17fc9c93f0844917905bf485f153c8fa 1b0a5fd0cf0146ae9943c4c615890612
#: 22a13a80e456414e8b051e6d01b70830 2c749d5ad1be4b6b86cc3bf01faeacd6
#: 4d1e05c58c314a36888f988abe01a5c4
msgid ""
"if bit 4 is set, then the RX pin has a weak pull down resistor activated."
msgstr "如果第4位置位，则RX引脚激活弱下拉电阻。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-options.rst:533
#: 008ac673650f42f7b0b7c319279c0272 264d0a5f968347e186b3a12e794d830d
#: 4f8d9248495d4e42b041bc4a049fed4a 60479dc116b04742be4da5a3c8b3ad06
#: c3b2f7e3a6f243aaa328e52a0a7856c4
msgid ""
"if bit 5 is set, then the RX pin has a weak pull up resistor activated."
msgstr "如果第5位置位，则RX引脚激活弱上拉电阻。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-options.rst:534
#: 11d176c5b43f4fe08eb84474a0c5319b 4580d37f1a454773abec595c9ae45db6
#: 51fed08d4c56404ea742e228ad9e54b0 b8bc689907d84b229696d9e824f02493
#: bd534838a1724c579281f9ba16d4e9e6
msgid ""
"if bit 6 is set, then the TX pin has a weak pull down resistor activated."
msgstr "如果第6位置位，则TX引脚激活弱下拉电阻。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-options.rst:535
#: 030622a077e442339ab005ab8302f987 1cd0d3119f5d4bc7a5b5b1ea1fcc81f7
#: 263068f4b1fe4f32b054772e9182ffff 67c221ea622849ec9d1de618de658907
#: 7920e5c022f245999bed82ab407bf1c1
msgid ""
"if bit 7 is set, then the TX pin has a weak pull up resistor activated."
msgstr "如果第7位置位，则TX引脚激活弱上拉电阻。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-options.rst:536
#: 034f758e5ff248a6b9f073345cc0c3a4 068fcc9d0cdf4c21a89178c4458508c8
#: 9be26cbc3adb49fbbcb3d1ee85c78607 adab8d9d4340497fa3faa57cc61c7128
#: e6da5e3f268a463c92a0b88f5c66835b
