"if bit 8 is set, then the RX has no DMA activated (assuming DMA is available"
" on this UART)"
msgstr "如果第8位置位，则RX未激活DMA（假设该UART上DMA可用）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-options.rst:537
#: 3428d3315ab24b7cad42110a441dfa29 50ca3a5c089b4229a38e3e4463c77e73
#: 869452431c02456ca10c7f4d4fa38672 8cc687ef1f454ee39426e89c0516e306
#: f7e6f7220d7e4edcba23096c88b59e0e
msgid ""
"if bit 9 is set, then the TX has no DMA activated (assuming DMA is available"
" on this UART)"
msgstr "如果第9位置位，则TX未激活DMA（假设该UART上DMA可用）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-options.rst:538
#: 5ae82ebec5f44e0e9edd7b80890febf0
msgid ""
"if bit 10 is set, then MAVLink forwarding will not be active on this UART "
"port."
msgstr "如果第10位置位，则该UART端口上不会激活MAVLink转发。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-options.rst:539
#: 2584a2bac96543e4833209e9c491482c 51466cfef8c34343b360f916370c6553
#: b5558af1149642af8af0f3819f8c7bcf bb44f41574d84477a33391ea1e52e10f
#: dd9536fedf4546618bd09ece5d1b0f75
