msgstr "如果第11位置位，则H7飞控中的硬件FIFO被禁用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-options.rst:540
#: a4c7943abbb2473caeb7a0e05c9e5582
msgid ""
"if bit 12 is set, the GCS are prevented from changing the MAVLink message "
"stream rates set by the ``SRx_...`` parameters."
msgstr "如果第12位置位，则GCS无法更改由 ``SRx_...`` 参数设置的MAVLink消息流速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-options.rst:542
#: 604ca543e42b4889b2a915d082721db0 77d11ed2aa584381803757bc5cd2c623
#: 8e62168b516a4e4097f12f406b886c84 ba0a73c5ba804956b6720e6498d43a72
#: e23f953ec6254142aca8112d1aadfd01
msgid ""
"HalfDuplex is supported on all ChiBiOS based autopilots, but inversion and "
"swap are only supported on boards with F7 or H7 microprocessors."
msgstr "半双工在所有基于ChibiOS的飞控上均受支持，但反转和交换仅在配备F7或H7微处理器的飞控板上受支持。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-options.rst:538
#: 47e8f29d3f0a4500acb198bb1d0d2892 71abcc7ff0bf4742b21480ce06615017
#: 7d90ce6e32234ea287a3fffd01ff5236 b4c75ed9917c4361ba3ec3d89694be1c
msgid ""
"if bit 10 is set, then MAVLink forwarding will not be active on this UART "
"port. (moved to MAVx_OPTIONS in 4.7 and later)"
msgstr "如果置位 bit 10，则此 UART 端口上不启用 MAVLink 转发。（4.7 及更高版本中已移至 MAVx_OPTIONS）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-options.rst:540
#: 114d5df44edc45519972c598a60947dd 550523c7120b407a93a3126df29f2c42
#: e2c198d883b6473887d4fd3e0a658496 e53a96746c0440d8ae4d6c99ae3019f8
msgid ""
"if bit 12 is set, the GCS are prevented from changing the MAVLink message "
"stream rates set by the ``SRx_...`` parameters.(moved to MAVx_OPTIONS in 4.7"
" and later)"
msgstr ""
"如果置位 bit 12，则禁止地面站更改由 ``SRx_...`` 参数设定的 MAVLink 消息流速率。（4.7 及更高版本中已移至 "
"MAVx_OPTIONS）"

